Look with your heart and truly see

2
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Find that the truth is not far away

3
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Hey you good or bad, truth or lies

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Can't escape this gray smoke of the heart

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Bring along all of your courage

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
And maybe you can save this world

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

8
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

10
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
The computer game MagiEye Angel is all the rage in Tuna Town

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Even Jingjing is hooked on it

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Meanwhile, many players are falling ill one after another

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
This seems to be inextricably linked to the Illumin-Eye

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Heart of Vitality

15
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,079
Locky, how's Jingjing doing now?

16
00:01:31,079 --> 00:01:38,000
The doctor says her symptoms match those mysterious coma patients we were investigating

17
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,280
They can't find the cause

18
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:42,960
How strange. Even Jingjing couldn't resist

19
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:46,079
There's definitely something fishy about this game

20
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:51,359
What's going on?

21
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:52,960
Quick, check on Jingjing!

22
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Strange. Where did the doctors and nurses go?

23
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Locky, don't go over there! It's too dangerous!

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:31,539
Damn it!

25
00:02:31,539 --> 00:02:34,300
They're all under MagiEye's control now

26
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:36,439
So what do we do now?

27
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:38,800
Take Jingjing and get out of here!

28
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,479
Try not to look at those screens.

29
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:50,099
The Illumin-Eye has appeared on every screen!

30
00:02:50,099 --> 00:02:50,699
Don't look!

31
00:02:50,699 --> 00:02:52,300
If you do, you'll never come back.

32
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:04,139
What are all these lights?

33
00:03:04,139 --> 00:03:13,199
Uncle! Uncle! Wake up!

34
00:03:13,199 --> 00:03:15,420
Please wake up, Uncle!

35
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:18,560
Wh-what's going on?

36
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:21,599
We're in big trouble this time.

37
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:25,400
Th-this place...

38
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:28,780
Seems we've landed somewhere incredible.

39
00:03:28,780 --> 00:03:31,420
And Jingjing is gone too.

40
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,780
Now what do we do?

41
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:59,240
H-Hawxing?

42
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:06,219
Hawxing, you're in the game too?

43
00:04:06,219 --> 00:04:08,740
I infiltrated the game to investigate.

44
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:11,700
You weaklings, get out of here while you can.

45
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,740
Even though you saved me,

46
00:04:13,740 --> 00:04:16,680
I still hate you.

47
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,740
The situation is critical.

48
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:21,000
This evil game

49
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,939
has taken control of everyone.

50
00:04:22,939 --> 00:04:24,980
We have to save them all.

51
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:28,780
We need to find a way to catch the one behind this game.

52
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:32,960
There are abnormal energy signals flowing in virtual space.

53
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,740
What's this?

54
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:39,460
Following this energy will definitely lead us to a clue.

55
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:46,840
Where did you get that tool?

56
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:50,259
It's just mental manifestation.

57
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:54,560
The game world can turn everything people imagine

58
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,839
into physical form.

59
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:58,680
Do we have to use this tool

60
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:01,360
to ride on the energy flow?

61
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,339
According to my calculations,

62
00:05:02,339 --> 00:05:04,220
going along the energy flow

63
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:06,639
can get us to the energy source endpoint in the shortest time.

64
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:08,079
And this single-board tool

65
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:10,240
can reduce drag to a minimum.

66
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,560
But be careful.

67
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,100
A high-intensity energy flow

68
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:14,840
is enough to destroy a building.

69
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:17,279
In the game world, people can

70
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:20,300
fulfill desires that can't be fulfilled in the real world.

71
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:23,000
That's why these games are so popular.

72
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,720
Uncle! I almost touched the energy flow!

73
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:29,279
Don't shake.

74
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:31,079
Help!

75
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:33,720
Wait, Uncle!

76
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:36,480
I thought I heard Jingjing's voice.

77
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:36,759
What?

78
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:46,300
That... that's...

79
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,980
Locky!

80
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:50,860
Was that really Jingjing just now?

81
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:53,300
That's Jingjing.

82
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:59,699
Jingjing, are you okay?

83
00:05:59,699 --> 00:06:06,660
Locky, you came.

84
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:08,960
Don't worry, Jingjing.

85
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:11,259
We're definitely going to get you out of here.

86
00:06:11,259 --> 00:06:15,600
It was The Illumin-Eye that trapped me here.

87
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,740
The Illumin-Eye, them again. Damn them.

88
00:06:18,740 --> 00:06:21,240
The Illumin-Eye has collected so much energy.

89
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,639
There must be a major purpose.

90
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:23,699
We need to find out.

91
00:06:23,699 --> 00:06:27,579
Found it.

92
00:06:27,579 --> 00:06:28,660
What's up?

93
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:29,480
Hawxing?

94
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,460
Did you find something?

95
00:06:31,460 --> 00:06:37,920
This... what is this?

96
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,340
MagiEye's energy convergence point.

97
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:40,980
Just destroy this.

98
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:44,960
Welcome to the charming Heart of Vitality.

99
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:45,439
Who?

100
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:48,460
That's a very good question.

101
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:50,460
Don't be afraid, my dear friend.

102
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:53,520
It's you again, you annoying pest.

103
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:55,300
What exactly are you trying to do?

104
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:58,440
There's no harm in telling you.

105
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:03,400
Vitality and youth are wasted on the likes of you.

106
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:07,040
You might as well hand them over to us, The Illumin-Eye, for safekeeping.

107
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,600
You money-grubbing game makers.

108
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,280
I won't let you get away with this.

109
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:24,220
Guards!

110
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:26,100
Take good care of our honored guests.

111
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:37,400
Heart of Vitality collection complete.

112
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:40,140
Thanks to all our dear players for your kind support.

113
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:42,200
We can't let him get away with this.

114
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,220
Stop him!

115
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:44,480
Stop him!

116
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:50,560
Mission accomplished.

117
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,980
Dazzling vitality and energy

118
00:07:52,980 --> 00:07:56,700
As adorable as an Oscar statuette.

119
00:07:56,700 --> 00:08:08,439
Dear little friends,

120
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:10,120
See you on our next show!

121
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:38,420
What's going on?

122
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:39,960
What happened?

123
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:42,259
I've got no strength left.

124
00:08:42,259 --> 00:08:43,159
Doctor!

125
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,460
Quick, call a doctor!

126
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:48,420
So pretty

127
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:49,960
Yeah

128
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:52,379
We really should get out more often

129
00:08:52,379 --> 00:08:57,060
Now that game was a real thrill

130
00:08:57,060 --> 00:09:00,000
But it was so scary

131
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,280
Jingjing's never playing that again

132
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:08,000
The Illumin-Eye took the Heart of Vitality

133
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,300
Their plan succeeded this time

134
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,740
Who knows what schemes they'll come up with next

135
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:42,720
[MagiEye Angel]

136
00:09:42,740 --> 00:10:12,720
[Ending Song]

137
